[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2644332830","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102534#issuecomment-2644332830","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102534","id":2644332830,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dnVEe","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T23:42:44Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T23:42:44Z","body":"Custom Resource Array gets highlighted for CustomResource.gd, even though it doesn't (and shouldn't) accept it.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/685b7178-160c-4506-bd94-3ef4930b234c\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2644332830/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2644744892","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102534#issuecomment-2644744892","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102534","id":2644744892,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6do5q8","user":{"login":"ttencate","id":90930,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwOTMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90930?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate","html_url":"https://github.com/ttencate","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-08T09:28:10Z","updated_at":"2025-02-08T09:55:39Z","body":"@KoBeWi Great find! But that bug is also present in the current master, not caused by this PR :grin: In fact, you can also drag `CustomResource.gd` onto the `custom_resource` property, which even accepts it despite being the wrong type. (You can also drag it onto `resource` and `resource_array`, but that makes sense because `Script` inherits from `Resource`.)\r\n\r\nI'll see if I can find out why that happens and contribute a fix<s>, but I don't think it needs to block this PR</s>.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2644744892/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2644828698","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102534#issuecomment-2644828698","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102534","id":2644828698,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dpOIa","user":{"login":"ttencate","id":90930,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwOTMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90930?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate","html_url":"https://github.com/ttencate","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-08T10:24:51Z","updated_at":"2025-02-08T10:27:27Z","body":"Correction: it _does_ need some work in this PR because I copied the faulty logic into `EditorPropertyArray` for the case of dropping a `\"resource\"` type (e.g. from another property) onto the array itself.\r\n\r\nThe cause is this bit here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/36d90c73a843afa2807a0b8dcbfbf52bdb8a759c/editor/editor_resource_picker.cpp#L689-L692\r\n\r\nI'm not sure what the purpose of that code is. `_is_type_valid` already checked whether the type inherits from one of the allowed types, both for built-in and custom classes. But I'll assume that it's good for something, and not just remove it.\r\n\r\nThe bug happens because `EditorNode::get_object_custom_type_name()` returns the `global_class` name of the script set on the object, but also if the object is _itself_ a `Script`, [it returns its `global_class`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/36d90c73a843afa2807a0b8dcbfbf52bdb8a759c/editor/editor_node.cpp#L4790-L4792). No idea why that is useful; it seems like conflating two different things. This method was introduced in 4f721788681 for use in a tooltip in `SceneTreeEditor`, where it's only called for `Node`s so the object can never be a `Script` anyway. Since then, usage has been added in e8f15f79968 for the `EditorResourcePicker`, where it's explicitly only used to get the `global_class` of `Script` objects directly. And this was subsequently changed in d32f2700ffd, now calling it with the resource itself rather than the resource's script, introducing the bug.\r\n\r\nFor now, I'll add another commit to this PR that fixes the bug in the least invasive way possible, and also modify the commit where I copied the bug to the `EditorPropertyArray`. But I think all this logic is too convoluted and too scattered, and should be cleaned up at some point.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2644828698/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2644868311","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102534#issuecomment-2644868311","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102534","id":2644868311,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dpXzX","user":{"login":"ttencate","id":90930,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwOTMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90930?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate","html_url":"https://github.com/ttencate","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-08T10:42:38Z","updated_at":"2025-02-08T10:42:38Z","body":"Should all be fixed now, please take another look.\r\n\r\nFYI, I would rather not squash these commits together, because each of them can stand on its own. If any regressions are introduced, bisecting and focused reverting is easier this way.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2644868311/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708436477","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102534#issuecomment-2708436477","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102534","id":2708436477,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hb3X9","user":{"login":"ttencate","id":90930,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwOTMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90930?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate","html_url":"https://github.com/ttencate","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/subscriptions","organizations_url":"h